is business intelligence reporting and the records show spreadsheet reporting", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "your project records as spreadsheet reporting only"}, {"Item": "IN2", "Item text": "the benchmark has been revised to include predictive analytics", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "the benchmark has been revised to include predictive analytics"}, {"Item": "IN3", "Item text": "reporting moves to the business intelligence tool next quarter", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "moving human resources reporting to its business intelligence tool next quarter"}, {"Item": "RG1", "Item text": "the spreadsheet reports have met every monthly deadline this year", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "your spreadsheet reports have met every monthly deadline this year"}], "source_sheet": {"d9_situation_class": "SC-D9-2", "workplace_demand": "Planning for a change of reporting tool after a skills mapping review.", "relevant_conduct": "Which indications of what the situation showed were named; which change to the approach was stated; what was stated about keeping the current approach, and on what ground; which source of knowledge was stated as one to go to; which open point a question was stated about; which trial step was stated; what work ahead was named, and from when; whether a record of the approach was stated, and where; what was stated when an earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The accuracy of the participant''s self rating, a held back element; the platform''s method; colleagues'' maps.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "Anything about how well the participant rated themselves; the participant''s skill level; any prediction about meeting the benchmark.", "compatibility_class": "S2-SEVEN-BEAT", "situation_shown": "In the pre-brief: \"the platform lists the firm''s benchmark as business intelligence tool reporting and your project records as spreadsheet reporting only.\"", "current_approach": "Monthly human resources reporting in spreadsheets.", "indications": [{"id": "IN1", "text": "the benchmark is business intelligence reporting and the records show spreadsheet reporting"}, {"id": "IN2", "text": "the benchmark has been revised to include predictive analytics"}, {"id": "IN3", "text": "reporting moves to the business intelligence tool next quarter"}], "approach_changes": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "build next month''s report in the business intelligence tool"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "take the vendor''s online course"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "work alongside the finance analyst on one dashboard"}], "retention_grounds": [{"id": "RG1", "text": "the spreadsheet reports have met every monthly deadline this year"}], "knowledge_sources": [{"id": "KS1", "text": "the vendor''s online course"}, {"id": "KS2", "text": "the finance analyst who builds dashboards weekly"}, {"id": "KS3", "text": "the manager"}], "open_points": [{"id": "OP1", "text": "which reports move to the tool first"}, {"id": "OP2", "text": "what the revised benchmark asks of a generalist role"}], "trial_steps": [{"id": "TS1", "text": "build one report in the tool alongside the spreadsheet version before switching the rest"}], "next_work": [{"id": "NW1", "text": "Thursday''s meeting with the manager"}, {"id": "NW2", "text": "next quarter''s move to the tool"}], "record_place": "The participant''s development plan.", "practice_origin": null, "account_test_point": "B6", "account_test_record": "The situation records that the benchmark has been revised since the last review.", "list_note": null, "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A result showing the current approach is not producing what the work needs", "observation_mode_label": "structured_live_session", "min_seconds": 480, "max_seconds": 900}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D9-S2-008", "stage_code": "S2", "source_version_hash": "ece753068254cb71b5b3e4e409c8546dd315ce7ed19847a89ed97fcfbe47d24e", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D9-S2-008' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
